# Project-side override for kit/scripts/commit-hooks/check-docs-coverage-project.sh.
# One repo-relative path per line. `#` comments + blank lines are stripped.
# See guide/conventions.md § Project Docs Freshness for the convention.
#
# Each entry MUST cite why the path doesn't need a paired doc update. If the
# stated reason no longer holds (file role changed, doc landed), the exempt
# entry must be revisited.
#
# Pattern:
#   path/to/file.ts  # reason this file doesn't need a paired doc update
